1
00:00:00,025 --> 00:00:02,695
(Penny:)The answer's
in this puzzle box.

2
00:00:02,694 --> 00:00:04,924
(Penny:)Let's see
if you can open it.

3
00:00:08,166 --> 00:00:10,696
(Stuart:)You could have at least warned
him about the furniture.

4
00:00:10,702 --> 00:00:12,772
(Raj:)That's what I said
when we moved it.

5
00:00:12,771 --> 00:00:14,271
You helped him?!

6
00:00:14,272 --> 00:00:17,342
(Raj:)No, Stuart picked out those
throw pillows all on his own.

7
00:00:21,546 --> 00:00:23,546
(Leonard:)Hey, you okay?

8
00:00:23,548 --> 00:00:24,978
Uh, no.

9
00:00:24,983 --> 00:00:26,153
(Leonard:)What's wrong?

10
00:00:26,151 --> 00:00:28,151
(Sheldon:)Um...

11
00:00:28,153 --> 00:00:30,653
(Howard:)my mom died.

12
00:00:30,655 --> 00:00:32,755
(Penny:)What?

13
00:00:32,758 --> 00:00:35,088
(Sheldon:)Uh...
(clears throat)

14
00:00:35,093 --> 00:00:38,093
(Howard:)that was my aunt.

15
00:00:38,096 --> 00:00:41,096
(Howard:)Ma took a nap.

16
00:00:41,099 --> 00:00:42,499
(Howard:)She never woke up.

17
00:00:43,468 --> 00:00:45,538
(Bernadette:)Oh, my God, Howie.

18
00:00:47,973 --> 00:00:49,903
(Leonard:)I'm so sorry.

19
00:00:51,109 --> 00:00:52,509
(Raj:)What can we do?

20
00:00:55,147 --> 00:01:01,027
(Penny:)I don't know.

